{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":86,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"0ebffe06-b1d0-42c2-8e79-671a9a9edb49","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511066602,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"安卓开发工程师","OrgId":2149295,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1．参与Android终端产品软件开发的全过程;\r\n2．负责Android移动端程序框架设计以及核心功能开发;\r\n3．负责Android平台和移动端UI．交互设计等;\r\n4．负责软件系统的分析和架构设计工作;\r\n5．完善和优化Android的基本功能，应用层各种问题的分析和解决;\r\n6．设计并实现Android应用层的各种新加功能，完成对应的模块设计．编码及调试工作；","Require":"1．全日制本科及以上学历，2年以上Android应用实际开发经验，必须有独立开发应用的经验并了解安卓APP市场的上架规则；\r\n2．了解Android各系统版本差异，熟悉屏幕适配，常见兼容性问题的处理方案；\r\n3．熟悉 Android 界面生命周期, 线程, API 交互和 UI 组件；\r\n4．对手机软件性能优化．内存优化．安全等有一定了解；\r\n5．熟练掌握网络通信相关开发，熟悉TCP/IP．UDP ．MQTT．socket等；\r\n6．熟悉移动端软件交互原理和设计规范。\r\n\r\n加分项：有视频．音频传输相关功能APP项目经历者优先考虑。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-09-11T17:36:21","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"754071e4-ef7d-454f-8039-3b648e0cc651","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511066601,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"JAVA开发工程师","OrgId":2149295,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1．参加基于Java技术的项目开发；\r\n2．参与系统分析与设计，并负责完成项目模块核心代码开发；\r\n3．根据开发规范与流程在产品框架基础上独立完成模块的设计．编码．测试以及相关文档；\r\n4．能独立解决开发中遇到的难点问题；\r\n5．负责开发过程中相关新技术的研究和验证。\r\n\r\n","Require":"1．计算机相关专业，3年及以上Java开发经验；\r\n2．Java基础扎实，理解IO．多线程．集合等基础框架，对JVM原理有一定的了解；\r\n3．熟悉软件技术文档的编写，具备良好的文档编制习惯和代码书写规范；\r\n4．熟悉javascript．html/xhtml．xml．css．ajax．vue等前端技术；\r\n5．熟悉TCPIP．UDP协议，并能进行相关的开发工作；\r\n6．熟练使用Java开源框架（Spring．SpringBoot．Srping Cloud．MyBatis等）,并对于使用过的开源框架，能了解到它的原理和机制；\r\n7．熟悉MySQL． Oracle．SqlServer等其中一种数据库，有sql优化经验者优先；\r\n8．掌握常用的开发工具，如idea，eclipse，maven，git，svn等；\r\n9．熟练Linux操作系统基本操作命令，熟悉redis．MQ 等常用中间件；\r\n10．具有较强的学习．分析问题解决问题的能力，具有良好的团队合作精神及灵活的沟通的能力。\r\n11．具有电力巡检机器人平台开发经验者优先。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-09-11T17:36:21","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"bd779f9e-8c87-4987-9992-ca1afdc78bf2","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511066600,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"前端开发工程师","OrgId":2149295,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.负责主线产品APP及Web系统、推广活动等前端页面的开发和优化；\n2.结合自己在产品和交互方面的广泛应用，不断优化和改善用户体验;\n3.封装复用性高、可维护性好的前端组件，通过开发工具/框架、改进流程，保证前端开发的高效性，不断优化团队前后端分离架构，提高团队开发效率和质量；\n4.关注前端技术前沿，及时把新技术转化为业务开发中的生产力；\n5.持续探索在各种场景下，利用AI能力增强产品体验，提升工程效率。","Require":"1.精通HTML5、CSS3，具备多浏览器兼容经验，三年以上Web前端开发相关经验；\n2.熟练掌握JavaScript/TypeScript，至少深入掌握一个主流库或框架，如Vue3等;\n3.具备移动端Web开发经验，掌握多终端适配技巧;\n4.熟悉至少一门后端开发语言，具备一定算法能力；\n5.熟练使用至少一种前端可视化类库（如threejs等），有canvas/svg开发经验者优先\n6.对前端技术有兴趣，热爱钻研沉淀和分享。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-09-11T17:36:21","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"66f1933d-903d-4dd8-8d80-8be5bfc5cfa7","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511066595,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"技术支持工程师","OrgId":2149294,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1．以公司产品（四足机器狗．六轴协作机械臂等）产品为核心，协助销售部门进行售前售中售后技术支持；\r\n2．负责对客户进行产品软硬件培训（硬件操作．软件使用以及二次开发等），完成设备交付；\r\n3．负责设备交付后的技术答疑．故障诊断处理．安排售后维修等工作；\r\n4．基于日常培训内容．整理已知问题解决办法，总结形成文档．视频，形成．完善产品知识库；\r\n5．整理产品问题．客户需求，形成合理的研发需求反馈给研发\\产品经理，促进产品完善．升级；\r\n6．负责样机及售后备用机仓库管理，建立售后机器管理流程。负责制定售后标准化服务流程，并完成过程管控\r\n7．售前技术部分工作内容：负责机器人巡检．监控集成项目需求调研，充分与销售人员．客户沟通交流，对需求进行挖掘和引导，输出解决方案，进行客户现场踏勘．需求分析．技术方案编制；负责与客户进行技术交流，技术方案讲解，机器狗演示等工作\r\n","Require":"\r\n1. 全日制本科及以上学历，理工科类专业背景，自动化．机电相关专业，2年以上相关工作经验（优秀应届毕业生亦可）；\r\n2. 具有C语言或脚本语言编程基础，熟悉linux系统者优先，热爱机器人有技术基础者为优先。\r\n3. 较强的沟通能力．学习能力．动手能力，有责任心能适应短期出差；及时响应客户需求，建立良好的客户合作关系，提高客户满意度；\r\n4. 同时也开放海外技术支持工程师岗位，附加要求：有一定的英语听说读基础，英语口语流利者优先。能协助代理商进行本地化销售和开展相关工作，具有国际展会相关经验，能够运作海外招投标项目，能够适应短期出差。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-09-11T17:34:38","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"7ca00c18-8287-432e-b203-357acf622141","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511066592,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"海外销售运营管理","OrgId":2149294,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1. 对接海外代理商，维护代理商关系，根据公司要求执行代理商相关政策并落地；\n2. 完善代理商目标规划与制定，并对月度、季度、年度业绩监控；根据考核标准评价代理商运营状况，对代理商政策及激励方案提出优化建议；\n3. 参与协助海外销售策略制定与执行，根据市场情况、竞对分析和公司目标，对销售目标制定与完成监控、销售激励等提供建议；\n4. 数据分析：对销售数据多维度分析，输出数据分析报告，为决策提供数据支持；\n5. 流程优化：熟悉销售业务逻辑和系统操作，根据业务需要，对CRM系统流程提出优化建议；","Require":"1. 本科及以上学历，市场营销、工商管理等相关专业优先；\n2. 2年以上销售运营/销售支持相关经验，对机器人行业有一定了解；\n3. 熟练使用数据分析及系统管理工具（Excel/CRM/ERP系统等）；\n4. 英语听说读写熟练，可对接海外客户。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-09-11T17:34:14","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"8380da74-7c83-486e-b247-5b43d462163e","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":511066588,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"嵌入式软件工程师（Linux)","OrgId":2149295,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"岗位职责\r\n1. 负责嵌入式系统及相关模块的驱动开发、调试、BUG分析；\r\n\r\n2. 负责需求分析、详细设计文档及模块单元测试用例等文档编写；\r\n\r\n3. 为基于嵌入式Linux系统的应用开发提供支持；\r\n\r\n4. 持续优化驱动性能，根据产品反馈持续迭代和优化产品软件功能及体验；\r\n\r\n5. 协助测试人员完成软件的测试。","Require":"任职要求\r\n1. 统招本科及以上学历，2年以上嵌入式驱动开发经验，熟悉Linux内核，具备Linux BSP开发经验；\r\n2. 至少熟悉英伟达、全志、瑞芯微等主流开发平台其中的一种，熟悉嵌入式平台驱动框架，对驱动模块如SPI/UART/USB/FLASH/Camera/GPS/LCD有深入了解；\r\n3. 精通嵌入式C/C++ 编程开发、精通Linux操作系统，能够独立移植Linux系统，有裁剪、优化经验者优先；\r\n4. 具有良好的编程思想和代码规范，程序结构条理清晰，可读性强；\r\n5. 对新知识充满热情，思维灵活，动手能力及执行能力强，有良好的沟通能力，协作精神和进取心，工作态度积极；\r\n6. 有视频图像处理、编解码的相关编程经验者优先；\r\n7. 优秀应届毕业生可适当放宽条件。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-09-11T17:32:58","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null}],"Total":0}